 "name_en": "Bank Integration with File Interface (1EG)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Bank Integration with File Interface (1EG)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio6aefb24d971448d6a01c91645205d923\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6aefb24d971448d6a01c91645205d923__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">In this scope item, you download the payment files for outgoing payments, which have been generated by <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> to your computer. You can then upload these payment files to your banking portal or treasury workstation for payment processing.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">You can also upload the electronic bank statements sent from your bank. The statements are further processed using <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span>.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6aefb24d971448d6a01c91645205d923__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Download payment instruction file created by <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span></li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Upload bank statement from bank to SAP S/4HANA</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6aefb24d971448d6a01c91645205d923__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Process payment and bank statements electronically</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Take a practical approach for electronic processing of payment instructions and bank statements</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>银行与文件接口集成 (1EG)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio6aefb24d971448d6a01c91645205d923\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6aefb24d971448d6a01c91645205d923__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">在此范围项目中，将 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 生成的付款的付款文件下载到您的计算机。然后，您可以将这些付款文件上载到银行门户或资金工作站以进行付款处理。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">您还可以上传银行发送的电子银行对账单。使用 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 进一步处理对账单。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6aefb24d971448d6a01c91645205d923__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">下载由 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 创建的付款指令文件</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将银行对账单从银行上载到 SAP S/4HANA</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6aefb24d971448d6a01c91645205d923__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">以电子方式处理付款和银行对账单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">采取切实可行的方法，以电子方式处理付款指令和银行对账单</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
